# Hash-pinned sidecar venvs (built on demand by ne.envbuild.ensure_sidecar_venv).
# The GPL igraph / Splink / LightRAG closures live ONLY here, never in uv.lock.
.splink-venv/
.splink-venv.lock
.lightrag-venv/
.lightrag-venv.lock
# uv-managed Python interpreters (installed beside the venv by
# ne.envbuild.ensure_sidecar_venv when no suitable system Python exists).
.uv-python/
# uv's download cache for those sidecar builds (kept beside the venv so the
# multi-gigabyte closure lands on the venv's own persistent, disk-backed
# volume rather than uv's $HOME-derived default).
.uv-cache/
